      "end_ms": 442700,
      "text": "本身是没有程序的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 442700,
      "end_ms": 444680,
      "text": "但是有了先天金丹"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "start_ms": 444680,
      "end_ms": 447960,
      "text": "有了这个至阳温养和"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 136,
      "start_ms": 447960,
      "end_ms": 449740,
      "text": "那就有了辰戌"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "start_ms": 449740,
      "end_ms": 454529,
      "text": "有了辰戌就有了就是把力量整合"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "start_ms": 454529,
      "end_ms": 458220,
      "text": "然后对外发出去的那个关键的机制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "start_ms": 458220,
      "end_ms": 461200,
      "text": "那个枢纽就能够把先天至阳之气啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "start_ms": 461200,
      "end_ms": 465939,
      "text": "至至阳过于强烈的那个那个力量过于直白的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "start_ms": 465939,
      "end_ms": 467119,
      "text": "要把它转化成"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "start_ms": 467119,
      "end_ms": 472110,
      "text": "是可以驱动现实发生变化的乏力啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "start_ms": 472110,
      "end_ms": 474770,
      "text": "所以这是个先啊先天技能"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "start_ms": 474770,
      "end_ms": 479570,
      "text": "那么承担的过程当中是要遭受雷劫的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "start_ms": 480690,
      "end_ms": 484210,
      "text": "啊存档过程当中是要遭受雷劫"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "start_ms": 487040,
      "end_ms": 488740,
      "text": "那么如何渡劫呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "start_ms": 488740,
      "end_ms": 491140,
      "text": "那我们就合并在这一讲里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "start_ms": 491140,
      "end_ms": 494000,
      "text": "讲一讲如何度过这个雷劫"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "start_ms": 499640,
      "end_ms": 504040,
      "text": "这个这就是到先天金丹的第三个名字啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "start_ms": 505120,
      "end_ms": 509160,
      "text": "都或者说这也是度过雷劫的一个一个过程"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 151,
      "start_ms": 509160,
      "end_ms": 510320,
      "text": "他渡劫的这个过程"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 152,
      "start_ms": 511440,
      "end_ms": 514480,
      "text": "渡劫这个过程我们叫做叫做什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 153,
      "start_ms": 517200,
      "end_ms": 518860,
      "text": "或者说承担的过程啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 154,
      "start_ms": 518860,
      "end_ms": 520760,
      "text": "承担的过程"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 155,
      "start_ms": 521299,
      "end_ms": 522639,
      "text": "承担的过程"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 156,
      "start_ms": 522639,
      "end_ms": 524019,
      "text": "结丹的过程啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 157,
      "start_ms": 524019,
      "end_ms": 525819,
      "text": "我们用劫这个词更好呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 158,
      "start_ms": 525819,
      "end_ms": 529939,
      "text": "结丹的过程他就叫普罗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 159,
      "start_ms": 534140,
      "end_ms": 536060,
      "text": "歌栾啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 160,
      "start_ms": 537140,
      "end_ms": 538380,
      "text": "鸾肉的卵啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 161,
      "start_ms": 538380,
      "end_ms": 539860,
      "text": "普罗戈卵"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 162,
      "start_ms": 539860,
      "end_ms": 542400,
      "text": "然后是这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 163,
      "start_ms": 544400,
      "end_ms": 546040,
      "text": "马太坠深啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 164,
      "start_ms": 548240,
      "end_ms": 549880,
      "text": "累赘坠啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 165,
      "start_ms": 550899,
      "end_ms": 555340,
      "text": "诶坠坠坠可不再赘述"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 166,
      "start_ms": 555340,
      "end_ms": 557500,
      "text": "可能写错了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 167,
      "start_ms": 558140,
      "end_ms": 561880,
      "text": "哦是个反是个被子底啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 168,
      "start_ms": 561880,
      "end_ms": 563450,
      "text": "不好意思啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 169,
      "start_ms": 563890,
      "end_ms": 565890,
      "text": "我这个人一直穷了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 170,
      "start_ms": 565890,
      "end_ms": 568310,
      "text": "被子马太最深啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 171,
      "start_ms": 568310,
      "end_ms": 570430,
      "text": "普罗哥伦马泰最深"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 172,
      "start_ms": 570430,
      "end_ms": 576770,
      "text": "那么他的泰西洋名普罗哥伦BLOGRAMM"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 173,
      "start_ms": 577770,
      "end_ms": 579450,
      "text": "马太最深"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 174,
      "start_ms": 580179,
      "end_ms": 581859,
      "text": "MARTIZATION啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 175,
      "start_ms": 583739,
      "end_ms": 585850,
      "text": "Programmatization"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 176,
      "start_ms": 586210,
      "end_ms": 590780,
      "text": "就是我刚说的这个金丹的又名叫程序"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 177,
      "start_ms": 590780,
      "end_ms": 592800,
      "text": "那么就叫程序化啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 178,
      "start_ms": 592800,
      "end_ms": 596580,
      "text": "当然这个程序还可以翻译成另外一个词啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 179,
      "start_ms": 599280,
      "end_ms": 601100,
      "text": "另外一个词好写吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 180,
      "start_ms": 601100,
      "end_ms": 602040,
      "text": "写的我人没了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 181,
      "start_ms": 602040,
      "end_ms": 606500,
      "text": "我靠嗯啊这这这算恶啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 182,
      "start_ms": 606500,
      "end_ms": 608100,
      "text": "尼玛载入史册"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 183,
      "start_ms": 608100,
      "end_ms": 608980,
      "text": "笑掉了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 184,
      "start_ms": 608980,
      "end_ms": 612290,
      "text": "普罗格伦意味着就是说人家渡雷劫吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 185,
      "start_ms": 612290,
      "end_ms": 613290,
      "text": "金丹是硬的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 186,
      "start_ms": 613290,
      "end_ms": 613590,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 187,
      "start_ms": 613590,
      "end_ms": 616109,
      "text": "普罗戈鸾鸾肉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 188,
      "start_ms": 616109,
      "end_ms": 621520,
      "text": "就是说无产阶级克服了他的这个私利啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 189,
      "start_ms": 621520,
      "end_ms": 622880,
      "text": "私利啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 190,
      "start_ms": 622880,
      "end_ms": 625340,
      "text": "或者说低级趣味"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 191,
      "start_ms": 626039,
      "end_ms": 627719,
      "text": "低级追求"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 192,
      "start_ms": 628580,
      "end_ms": 630800,
      "text": "要使得你的这个无产侧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 193,
      "start_ms": 630800,
      "end_ms": 633220,
      "text": "要克服他的私利和地级追求"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 194,
      "start_ms": 634260,
      "end_ms": 634860,
      "text": "另外一方面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 195,
      "start_ms": 634860,
      "end_ms": 636420,
      "text": "马太最深"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 196,
      "start_ms": 637690,
      "end_ms": 638790,
      "text": "马太效应"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 197,
      "start_ms": 638790,
      "end_ms": 640610,
      "text": "两极分化分化出来的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 198,
      "start_ms": 640610,
      "end_ms": 644690,
      "text": "你的这个精精纯的那一侧啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 199,
      "start_ms": 645110,
      "end_ms": 647190,
      "text": "精纯侧的精"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 200,
      "start_ms": 647190,
      "end_ms": 652220,
      "text": "精英侧通话说你的精英测得是最深的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 201,
      "start_ms": 653760,
      "end_ms": 655100,
      "text": "能涨多少涨多少"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 202,
      "start_ms": 655100,
      "end_ms": 658260,
      "text": "最深越精纯越越越精英测越好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 203,
      "start_ms": 658260,
      "end_ms": 660360,
      "text": "越精英测越好啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 204,
      "start_ms": 660960,
      "end_ms": 666020,
      "text": "就是说这个精英测的这种坠深的趋势"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 205,
      "start_ms": 666020,
      "end_ms": 672240,
      "text": "就是相当于那个溶液过饱和里面开始凝结了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 206,
      "start_ms": 672240,
      "end_ms": 675840,
      "text": "然后就是就是一一个点开始凝结"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 207,
      "start_ms": 675840,
      "end_ms": 678439,
      "text": "就是批量的开始凝结了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 208,
      "start_ms": 679370,
      "end_ms": 680550,
      "text": "过饱和"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 209,
      "start_ms": 680550,
      "end_ms": 682890,
      "text": "然后开始凝结"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 210,
      "start_ms": 683630,
      "end_ms": 686350,
      "text": "然后这个凝结意味着他是批量凝结"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 211,
      "start_ms": 686350,
      "end_ms": 688190,
      "text": "就是致密的那种关联"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 212,
      "start_ms": 688190,
      "end_ms": 692770,
      "text": "开始批量的生产出来的马太坠称MODIZATION啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 213,
      "start_ms": 692770,
      "end_ms": 695500,
      "text": "就是他是个啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 214,
      "start_ms": 697660,
      "end_ms": 699880,
      "text": "就是什么什么化程序化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 215,
      "start_ms": 699880,
      "end_ms": 704069,
      "text": "这个变化的过程激烈的发生了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 216,
      "start_ms": 704069,
      "end_ms": 707629,
      "text": "然后这个program这个是意味着某种程序"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 217,
      "start_ms": 707629,
      "end_ms": 708989,
      "text": "意味着这个无产测"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 218,
      "start_ms": 708989,
      "end_ms": 713480,
      "text": "他把他的私利和低级追求克服了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 219,
      "start_ms": 713600,
      "end_ms": 718049,
      "text": "然后呢投身于一个宏大的program啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 220,
      "start_ms": 718049,
      "end_ms": 720429,
      "text": "一个计划或者说一个程序啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 221,
      "start_ms": 720429,
      "end_ms": 722009,
      "text": "或者说是某种啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 222,
      "start_ms": 722009,
      "end_ms": 723500,
      "text": "Whatever"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 223,
      "start_ms": 726230,
      "end_ms": 730200,
      "text": "啊这个过程那个是是就是结单的过程"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 224,
      "start_ms": 730200,
      "end_ms": 733880,
      "text": "这结待过程呢就是说两种前提跟你们讲了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 225,
      "start_ms": 733880,
      "end_ms": 735400,
      "text": "一个是普罗哥伦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 226,
      "start_ms": 735400,
      "end_ms": 737000,
      "text": "还有是马泰可以坠身"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 227,
      "start_ms": 737000,
      "end_ms": 738180,
      "text": "就是你的精英侧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 228,
      "start_ms": 738180,
      "end_ms": 742229,
      "text": "可以就是裂变滚雪球一样快速增长了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 229,
      "start_ms": 742229,
      "end_ms": 747000,
      "text": "就是很就是就是人数上人数上啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 230,
      "start_ms": 747000,
      "end_ms": 749160,
      "text": "可以就是可以强者愈强了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 231,
      "start_ms": 749160,
      "end_ms": 753180,
      "text": "然后不停的就是说额变多变强变多变强了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 232,
      "start_ms": 753180,
      "end_ms": 754340,
      "text": "精英策变多变强了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 233,
      "start_ms": 754340,
      "end_ms": 755440,
      "text": "这是两个前提"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 234,
      "start_ms": 755440,
      "end_ms": 757540,
      "text": "还有一个前提就度过雷劫的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 235,
      "start_ms": 757540,
      "end_ms": 760760,
      "text": "还有一个前提是什么快"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 236,
      "start_ms": 762520,
      "end_ms": 765580,
      "text": "所以后面加个急急如律令啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 237,
      "start_ms": 768340,
      "end_ms": 771180,
      "text": "急急如律令这个口诀你们记好了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 238,
      "start_ms": 771180,
      "end_ms": 773660,
      "text": "急急如律令意味着要快越快越好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 239,
      "start_ms": 773660,
      "end_ms": 775060,
      "text": "最好是天雷没打下来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 240,
      "start_ms": 775060,
      "end_ms": 776869,
      "text": "你的单已经记好了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 241,
      "start_ms": 779000,
      "end_ms": 780760,
      "text": "啊天雷没有打下来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 242,
      "start_ms": 780760,
      "end_ms": 782360,
      "text": "你的单已经结好了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 243,
      "start_ms": 782360,
      "end_ms": 787069,
      "text": "而且往往这个单呢是哎呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 244,
      "start_ms": 787309,
      "end_ms": 788829,
      "text": "你劫不成什么好担的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 245,
      "start_ms": 788829,
      "end_ms": 791329,
      "text": "实事求是讲这个灵气稀薄啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 246,
      "start_ms": 791329,
      "end_ms": 796425,
      "text": "我就是说这个末法时代灵气稀薄"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 247,
      "start_ms": 799560,
      "end_ms": 804400,
      "text": "末法时代灵气细胞能够结一个中品丹就不错了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 248,
      "start_ms": 804400,
      "end_ms": 808120,
      "text": "中品这个金丹就已经不错了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 249,
      "start_ms": 808120,
      "end_ms": 809760,
      "text": "中平近战就不错了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 250,
      "start_ms": 809760,
      "end_ms": 815280,
      "text": "就是快就是一定要快一定要快啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 251,
      "start_ms": 815930,
      "end_ms": 818130,
      "text": "有个有个什么外丹修士"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 252,
      "start_ms": 818130,
      "end_ms": 820960,
      "text": "发现有这个什么草野武者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 253,
      "start_ms": 820960,
      "end_ms": 821860,
      "text": "民间武者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 254,
      "start_ms": 821860,
      "end_ms": 827720,
      "text": "我靠开始通过学的什么全真教道法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 255,
      "start_ms": 827720,
      "end_ms": 829460,
      "text": "反正就是那些内功啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 256,
      "start_ms": 829460,
      "end_ms": 834270,
      "text": "竟然是突破内功修修得内丹了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 257,
      "start_ms": 834270,
      "end_ms": 838310,
      "text": "这些这个外丹的这个修士就会过来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 258,
      "start_ms": 838310,
      "end_ms": 841190,
      "text": "把你用雷法把你击击碎"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 259,
      "start_ms": 841190,
      "end_ms": 843030,
      "text": "鸡为鸡粉啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 260,
      "start_ms": 843030,
      "end_ms": 845230,
      "text": "所以叫快急急如律令啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 261,
      "start_ms": 845230,
      "end_ms": 846510,
      "text": "只要你足够快"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 262,
      "start_ms": 846510,
      "end_ms": 849839,
      "text": "那律令化的这个法力就能生成出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 263,
      "start_ms": 850239,
      "end_ms": 853959,
      "text": "然后还有就是说尽量就是在你结单之前"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 264,
